        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SD-CSQ-8x8 8\" Square Glass Door Handles</b>\r\n<p>\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"text\" valign=\"center\">\r\n<p>\r\nLarge 8\" square glass door handles impeccably crafted from high grade 1/2\" thick non rusting aluminum, in your choice of 3 high quality powder coated, extra long lasting finish choices.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThese modern design door handles are perfect for your glass entry doors into your retail store. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPictured in <b>Duro Bronze finish</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>This Square glass door handle is available in <b>other sizes</b> and finishes, <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</a></b> for more information.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-SD-CSQ-8x8_size.jpg?v=1704354689\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions CSQ-8x8 Square Glass Door Pull size\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> of First Impressions SD-CSQ-8x8 Glass Door Handles\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material:  Solid Aluminum</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This beautiful  door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Sizes</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged with 2 square door handles and includes all the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pull Handles)</b>\r\n</p><p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This is  discontinued.</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
